* Per-plot linepattern p#line: only the keys this scheme's #include chain
* declares.  SchemeParser resolves p#line -> pline -> p# -> p
* itself, as Stata's scheme.class does, so nothing is written for a
* step the chain does not declare.
linepattern p  solid

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Added 24sep2026 by scripts/extract_scheme_truth.py (WP-16): directives
* Stata consumes that the translation above did not carry.  Values are
* resolved from the same Stata #include chain and style files as the
* rest of this file (chain: s2color -> s1color -> s1rcolor); colours are
