* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* BEGIN provenance (WP-17)
* Where every directive above comes from, written by
* scripts/extract_scheme_truth.py from the fixture's per-scheme `provenance'
* map (one line per directive, in the order of the groups above).
*   transcribed from <file>:<line> `<directive>'  a Stata scheme file in
*       this chain (s2color -> s1color -> s1rcolor) writes the very key this
*       translation carries; the value is that directive's, resolved.
*   inferred: <rule>  no Stata file writes the key dash reads; the value
*       is what Stata itself falls back to -- the documented
*       p#stub -> pstub -> p# -> p chain, a bare class default, the
*       generic `color grid', or an axisstyle indirection.
* Do not hand-edit this block: a re-run rewrites it in place when it
* differs, and leaves it alone when it does not.
* provenance: color background -- transcribed from scheme-s1rcolor.scheme:18 `color background black'
* provenance: color plotregion -- transcribed from scheme-s1rcolor.scheme:89 `color plotregion black'
* provenance: color legend -- transcribed from scheme-s1rcolor.scheme:93 `color legend black'
* provenance: color legend_line -- transcribed from scheme-s1rcolor.scheme:94 `color legend_line white'
* provenance: color major_grid -- transcribed from scheme-s1rcolor.scheme:57 `color major_grid gs5'
* provenance: color minor_grid -- transcribed from scheme-s1rcolor.scheme:58 `color minor_grid gs8'
* provenance: color heading -- transcribed from scheme-s1rcolor.scheme:28 `color heading white'
* provenance: color axisline -- transcribed from scheme-s1rcolor.scheme:60 `color axisline white'
* provenance: color p1 -- transcribed from scheme-s1rcolor.scheme:100 `color p1 yellow'
* provenance: color p2 -- transcribed from scheme-s1rcolor.scheme:101 `color p2 lime'
* provenance: color p3 -- transcribed from scheme-s1rcolor.scheme:102 `color p3 midblue'
* provenance: color p4 -- transcribed from scheme-s1rcolor.scheme:103 `color p4 magenta'
* provenance: color p5 -- transcribed from scheme-s1rcolor.scheme:104 `color p5 orange'
* provenance: color p6 -- transcribed from scheme-s1rcolor.scheme:105 `color p6 red'
